   "textLength": 481,
   "text": "The latest Apple AirPods are AirPods 5. Featuring Active Noise Cancellation, Adaptive Audio, improved sound and call quality, Personalised Spatial Audio and an open ear design. For even more choice, the Apple AirPods range at Officeworks includes AirPods 4, AirPods Pro 3, AirPods Max 2 and AirPods Max. Whether you’re after everyday wireless earbuds, in-ear headphones with advanced noise cancellati",
