   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [],
   "textLength": 312,
   "text": "AirPods 5 are Apple’s latest AirPods, designed for easy everyday listening with a comfortable open-ear fit. They support Siri AI and Voice Isolation, along with dust, sweat and water resistance. Choose between the USB-C Charging Case or Wireless Charging Case, depending on how you prefer to charge your AirPods.",
