   }
  },
  {
   "index": 17,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [],
   "textLength": 382,
   "text": "AirPods are designed with a more open fit, while AirPods Pro use interchangeable ear tips for a closer in ear fit. Both offer features designed to enhance sound and calls, while AirPods Pro include more advanced listening and noise control options. Choose from our range of Apple AirPods, including AirPods 5, AirPods 4 and AirPods Pro 3, to find the right fit and features for you.",
